    {
      "id": "std.t-latch",
      "name": "Ternary D latch",
      "description": "Level-sensitive trit latch on the 0/1/2 domain. E=2 captures D, E=0 holds, and E=1 gives an unknown trit. Two cross-coupled Kleene NANDs store the trit, so the state survives the enable transition; Q/QN power up at 0/2.",
